2026-07-27T06:10:16.1496755Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1497241Z i /tmp/RtmpCosiRh/duckdb
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1497595Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1497984Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1498649Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1499186Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1499993Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1500602Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1720458Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:10:16.1824671Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:10:16.2212431Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:10:16.2355148Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
